  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd a bounded ASCII DXF reader in `camcraft-geometry`.\nRead HEADER, TABLES, LAYER definitions, and basic planar entities.\nKeep drawing units explicit and preserve exact lines, circles, arcs, and polyline bulges.\nKeep layer names on primitives and count skipped annotations by kind.\nRefuse malformed input and unsupported geometry by name.\nAdd no dependencies.\n\nThis branch starts at upstream/main `3580f388821d604e602728495a53df1881889b0d`, as requested for this issue.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe geometry crate had no ASCII DXF reader.\nLater profile-import work needs shared primitives, explicit units, and input limits.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll 30 tests pass in `dxf` and `dxf_refusals`.\nThe initial tests failed to compile because unchanged upstream had no `dxf` module.\nThe layer-name limit also had a failing runtime pin before the guard was added.\n\nNamed pins include:\n\n- `dxf_rectangle_keeps_layers_and_explicit_units`\n- `dxf_missing_unitless_unknown_and_standard_scales_are_explicit`\n- `dxf_circle_and_wrapping_arc_stay_exact`\n- `dxf_bulge_sign_and_major_arcs_keep_the_exact_sweep`\n- `dxf_legacy_polyline_uses_parent_layer_and_closing_bulge`\n- `dxf_annotations_are_counted_by_kind`\n- `dxf_layer_name_length_is_bounded_before_segment_copies`\n- `dxf_declared_vertex_limit_is_checked_before_reading_vertices`\n- `dxf_nonfinite_and_out_of_range_geometry_is_refused`\n- `dxf_varying_z_within_and_between_entities_is_refused`\n- `dxf_input_entity_and_vertex_caps_are_enforced`\n- `dxf_deterministic_smoke_fuzz_never_panics`\n\nCopying the actual upstream `lib.rs` back made both suites fail with the missing-module error.\nRestoring the reader made both suites pass.\n\nRuntime mutation checks ran 72 experiments.\nSeventy experiments failed at runtime and passed after restoration.\nTwo individual changes remained unobservable:\n\n- `units_missing_at_variable`: the final HEADER check still refuses the missing value.\n- `missing_vertex_x`: callers only finish a pending vertex after X is present.\n\nRemoving both missing-unit checks failed a pin.\nReplacing both pending-coordinate checks also failed a pin.\nThe missing-X check alone remains unobservable through the public API.\nEvery restoration passed. No mutation remains in the branch.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 10 steps.\nThe geometry change expanded the gate to batch. The run took 42.7 minutes and needed no reruns.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry --all-targets -- -D warnings` also passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` has no output.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThis change adds the core reader. GUI import and downstream DXF machining workflows need later integration work.\nWindows and macOS builds were not run.\nRelease-heavy tests and pixel snapshots were not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changed the planned files at the overlap check.\n\nChangelog: Add a bounded ASCII DXF reader with explicit units, layers, exact planar primitives, and named input refusals.\n\nEffort: max\n\nFixes #1860\n",
